WEBVTT

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:14.070
<i>The season passed quietly, and Nagasaki 
was enjoying a lively late summer.</i>

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.850
<i>And it seems that the passage of time 
has brought someone to a decision.</i>

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.670
Keiko, the time has finally 
come to fulfill your desire...

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.760
What a problem...

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.310
I need to do something about this.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:56.730
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.730
Great Revolution

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>Cherry Blossom Baths</b>

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.950
Keiichiro! Keiichiro!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:21.820
<b>Episode 5: 
Later Summer in Nagasaki, 
on the Night the Lanterns Float</b>

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.740
Hurry it up!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.870
What's going on?

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:25.230
What's going on, Grannie?

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.950
Did you throw your back out?

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.630
Kiss!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:39.880
Keiichiro!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:43.050
Wh-What are you thinking, you old hag?!

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:47.310
Keiichiro, kiss me!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.270
S-Stop it!

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.400
Don't run.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.190
How could I not run? Have you gone mad?

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:57.460
Listen to me.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:00.530
I thought I would get rid of the curse 
that keeps you from touching women.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:01.660
What?

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.410
Then do it! Right now!

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:11.040
There's something you need 
in order to break the curse.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.120
It is...

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.540
It is...

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.250
The kiss of a virgin!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.460
K-Kiss?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.300
So I'll break it for you right now!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.410
Come on, kiss!

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.850
You're a virgin, Grannie?!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.440
It's been decades.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.600
I might as well be one!

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:33.400
Hell no! Don't just interpret 
that however you want!

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:37.020
Then is there anyone else who'll kiss you?

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.070
Don't you underestimate Keiichiro-sama!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.700
So you think you can do it?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.190
You better believe it!

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.660
I'll break the curse before you know it!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:58.830
Festivals are so arousing... I mean, fun.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.570
You're so pushy.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:06.260
Please, Chiharu! You're the only one for me.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.610
I don't care if you're a monster!

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:11.230
Step on me just a little more, please!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.060
No way, not even a little!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.690
I've already found the man I'm fated to be with.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.040
So stop following me around.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.740
B-But...

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:27.410
Please don't abandon me! 
Just a little, please!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.490
You pervert!

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:33.660
Get away from Chiharu-san!

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.040
It's okay now, Chiharu-san.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.820
Hyakusuke, this has nothing to do with you.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.000
Stay out of it.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.040
But I hate whiners like him.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.090
Are you the person Chiharu's 
fated to be with?

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:47.890
H-He is not!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.530
You're Keiichiro's buddy, aren't you?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.450
Fine, then.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.980
I'll tell everybody about you, Chiharu!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.150
I'll tell them a monster works 
at Cherry Blossom Baths.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.730
I'll tell them the water smells like animals!

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.020
Then nobody will come to the baths,

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:08.160
and you'll have to go back to your old job!

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.420
You stupid pig!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:14.000
You don't have to do 
anything he says, Chiharu-san.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.960
Will you forget about this 
if I spend the night with you?

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.810
I promise.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:21.840
Chiharu-san!

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:31.390
I'll be waiting at the foot 
of Kido Bridge tonight!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:35.140
You don't have to go, Chiharu-san.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.860
Of course I'm not going!

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:44.500
Why should I do anything to help 
that run-down old bathhouse?

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.320
It was a trick, of course.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.780
But you just said...

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:52.260
If it comes down to it, all I have to do is 
beat the crap out of him and then vanish.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:54.620
That'll feel a lot better for me!

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:58.330
Chiharu-san?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.960
A kiss?

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.410
Yes.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.340
A kiss from a virgin will break the curse.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.010
N-No...

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.870
If Keiichiro-sama kisses someone,

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:16.020
that foolish, lustful man is sure to have 
intercourse with a woman immediately,

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.480
and lose his virginity!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.980
Then he wouldn't be able to pilot Susanoo.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.900
That's why I want to ask you,

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.910
as part of your duty as a ninja.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.810
If you kiss him and break the curse,

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:35.490
he'll understand your feelings and 
become serious about piloting Susanoo.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:39.680
B-But I'm supposed to protect him.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.330
Even if it is my job, I can't kiss him.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:45.590
Then do you want him to kiss another girl?

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.220
W-Well...

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.380
Otomi-san!

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:53.200
Kiriko, I beg you...

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.970
Please break his curse!

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.690
<i>That is a bad cough...</i>

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:03.400
<i>Is she that sick?</i>

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.530
Hey, Chiharu.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.000
Kei-chan?

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.410
W-Would you... kiss me?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.120
What's gotten into you?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:21.810
I swear as a man that this is the 
last favor I'll ever ask of you!

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.630
You'd be saving my life!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.710
Please kiss me!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.130
No.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.970
What?! Why?

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:33.550
I'm not in the mood.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.220
Come on...

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.260
Please!

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:41.980
With one kiss, you can solve the problem 
that's hounded me for years!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.850
Please, just a little!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.660
I'm tired of hearing "just a little"!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.980
I've got a bigger problem right now!

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.990
I'll listen to it later!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.950
For now, just shut up and let me kiss you!

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:05.750
Please stop.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.680
K-Kiriko?

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.800
If you go any further, you'll be a pervert.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.300
A p-pervert?

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.840
We cannot have perverts 
in the Tokugawa family.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.300
I have to break the curse.

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.520
Wait, you're here, too...

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.150
This is perfect timing!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.860
If you kiss me, that'll solve everything!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.700
You, too, Keiichiro-sama?

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.750
Kiriko, I beg you...

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.860
Please break his curse!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.640
But I...

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.080
Please, Kiriko!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:41.480
I don't care who I kiss, 
as long as I get to kiss someone!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.210
Please let me kiss you!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.210
That hurt!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.670
What are you doing?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.190
Keiichiro-sama,

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:53.840
I'm disappointed in you.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.450
You're pathetic.

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:01.890
You're in the wrong here, Kei-chan.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.080
Damn it. What's her problem?

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.090
Keiichiro, it's time to light the fire.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.780
I don't feel like it.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:19.240
What's wrong?

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.750
You look really upset.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.960
Want to tell me what's going on?

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:28.170
It might help you feel better.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.150
I can understand why Kiriko-dono would slap you.

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.690
It's not funny.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.980
I see...

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.730
A curse that stops you from touching women?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.220
That's right.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.820
So even you could...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:57.060
Unfortunately, I can't help you.

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.490
I swore I'd maintain my chastity 
until I achieved my revenge.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.680
Don't you understand why 
Kiriko-dono looked so sad?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.250
Not a clue.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.670
Your feelings.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:15.070
I've been told a kiss is a sign of 
how two people feel for each other.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.380
I was totally feeling it.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.290
That's not it.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.490
I mean your feelings toward Kiriko-dono,

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.490
and her feelings, too.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:25.930
Her feelings?

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.190
Why not give it some thought?

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.690
I don't like complicated stuff.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:36.880
I guess men really are just lazy.

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:40.590
And so stubborn.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:49.680
I'm sorry that idiot was so insensitive.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:53.180
No, I was careless.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:55.050
I just moved before thinking about it.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:59.800
No, when men and women fight, 
the one who gets hit is at fault.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:03.100
I went through a lot of it myself, long ago.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:05.810
Otomi-san,

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:11.060
why did you decide to try 
to break the curse now?

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:14.480
A promise.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:15.770
A promise?

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:19.990
Yes, a promise I made 
with Keiichiro's mother.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.750
It's so pretty!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.960
<b>Lanterns Available</b>

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:41.890
Why here?

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:47.730
The town's too cheerful tonight 
for us to talk about the past.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:58.780
It all happened several years before 
you and Keiichiro were born.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:02.400
In 1854, when the black ships 
appeared off the coast of Japan,

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.280
the man now known as Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:08.790
used an Onigami named Takemikazuchi 
to drive them away.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.910
I've heard about this.

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:15.640
Shigeyoshi was imprisoned in 
Mito for what he did there.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:20.160
Yes, and so he lost his chance 
at the position of Shogun,

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:23.510
and Tokugawa Munetsugu-sama claimed it.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.800
But just before he became Shogun,

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:31.480
he fell in love with the second 
daughter of one of his concubines.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.850
That was Keiichiro's mother.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.100
And she rests here?

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.480
Yes. Her name was Keiko.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:44.730
At the time, I was a ninja working 
for the shogunate in Edo Castle,

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:47.070
and a good friend of hers.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:50.200
We were of very different ages, 
but we encouraged each other

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.850
and listened to each other's problems.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:57.870
Eventually, Keiko became pregnant 
with Munetsugu-sama's child.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:01.230
Love between those of different 
stations is a sad thing.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:04.670
She couldn't tell anyone, 
and that pained her.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.910
But word always gets out somehow.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:13.370
A high-ranking councilor, 
Matsudaira Sadachika-sama, found out.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.880
Sadachika-sama?

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:18.940
The man who ordered you to revive Susanoo.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.860
Sadachika-sama knew that if 
Shigeyoshi returned to Edo,

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:26.000
the world would be plunged into chaos.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.690
And so, in hopes of restoring 
peace if that were to happen,

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:34.160
he decided to entrust Keiko's 
unborn child with the future.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.750
Before the concubine found 
out about Keiko's pregnancy,

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:44.260
<b>Women-Fearing Curse</b>

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:44.170
Sadachika-sama ordered the curse 
to be placed on Keiko's body.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.640
If the child that was born remained a virgin,

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.080
he would be able to pilot 
Susanoo when the day came.

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:55.430
And I was given the order to hide Keiko 
and her unborn child in Nagasaki.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:58.280
And that's why you came here?

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:03.440
Yes... It was right after we got 
here that Keiichiro was born.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.500
But Keiko never recovered from the birth,

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:11.450
and she died while Keiichiro was still a baby.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:15.200
So he has no memory of his mother.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:19.710
You understand how painful it is 
to have no relatives, don't you?

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.680
I won't let them kill you!

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.590
Brother!

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.610
Be well, Kiriko.

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:32.220
Brother!

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.680
Before she died, Keiko often said

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:40.230
that she wanted Keiichiro to live a normal life.

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:45.110
I promised that I would raise 
him, no matter what.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:50.360
She died during the festival season, 
just this time of year.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:57.290
And that's why you decided to break 
the curse to fulfill your promise?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:02.790
Yes. He's old enough that he must 
choose how he'll live his own life.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:07.310
Your actions revived Susanoo.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:11.580
When you did, his life began to change.

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:15.720
It's his choice whether 
or not to pilot Susanoo.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:21.230
He understands that he's only 
seen a small part of the world.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.770
I won't tell him it's wrong 
to protect what he's seen.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:29.720
But protecting it is a hard thing to do.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.530
Just like it's been for me.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:36.460
But whether he chooses that, 
or chooses to go out into the world...

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.380
It's his choice to make.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.010
I wonder how many more times 
I'll see fireworks like these.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:58.170
Otomi-san, I've made my decision, as well.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:02.680
Yes, it's best for everyone to 
make these decisions themselves.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.270
Trouble! Kei-chan and 
Hyakusuke are in trouble!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.610
I-I understand!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.950
I'll never go near Chiharu again!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.750
Get lost!

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:32.380
Hyakusuke, what are you doing?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.950
Oh, Chiharu-san. It's okay now.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.970
You can keep working at the baths.

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:41.100
You got in a fight for that?

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.320
The boss always tells me you can only boast

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:49.520
after you've protected 
the people in front of you.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.940
You idiot! You should've just left me alone!

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.080
I could never do that.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:07.980
Keiichiro-sama...

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:11.300
Are you floating a lantern down the river?

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.500
Yes.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.160
They're beautiful.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.470
Yes. This is my first time seeing them.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:27.940
In my village, Obon was a time to light 
a small bonfire in memory of our ancestors.

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.940
That light's for my mother.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.960
I barely remember her,

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:39.300
but Grannie tells me she was a kind person.

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.910
I don't know why...

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:45.160
Whenever I try to remember, 
my head hurts right here.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:50.420
I'm sure it's something you 
don't need to remember.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.270
Maybe.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.490
Kiriko.

00:17:58.490 --> 00:17:59.740
Yes?

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.600
I won't kiss you.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:05.330
It looks like I was getting ahead of myself.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.560
I wasn't thinking about how you felt.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.050
So I can't kiss you.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.360
But the curse...

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:17.390
I've dealt with it my whole life.

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.320
It won't hurt me to live with it a little longer.

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.110
Keiichiro-sama.

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:21.910
Yeah?

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:26.310
Even if the curse is broken,

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:30.170
I will give up my life to defend your virginity.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.250
It won't break that easily,

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.620
unless Grannie forces a kiss on me.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.180
Um... Keiichiro-sama...

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.400
There's something I want to 
tell you about Otomi-san.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.440
What?

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.010
Well...

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.310
Are you okay, Grannie?

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.080
Otomi-san!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.830
Hey, Grannie! Don't die!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.030
Hang in there!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.540
Otomi-san!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.540
Grannie!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.800
I finally got it.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:21.600
A bone from the mackerel I ate 
yesterday was stuck in my throat.

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.590
It hurt my throat, and even made it bleed.

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.150
It was awful!

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.430
Now I feel much better.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.400
Eh? What's wrong?

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.960
Did you kiss yet?

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:36.480
I guess you young'uns are still too innocent.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:39.780
Getting rid of the curse will 
just have to wait a while.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.030
You stupid old woman!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:46.470
You had me worried for nothing!

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:48.150
Worried about what?

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:50.900
I'll send you to the underworld for real!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.110
I'd like to see you try it!

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.350
You're a virgin who can't even kiss a girl!

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.610
Shut up!

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:40.670
Morning, Kei-chan!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.050
Ch-Chiharu!

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:46.180
D-Didn't things work out with Hyakusuke?

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.770
We monsters can be fickle things!

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.260
Stop it! I'm going to break out again!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:51.930
Huh?

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.140
What's wrong?

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.610
You're so assertive today, Kei-chan!

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.810
I'm not breaking out!

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:09.830
All right! I'm not breaking out!

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:19.750
I did it, Kiriko!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:22.260
That stupid curse is finally gone!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:25.220
I finally have my chance to 
enjoy the pleasures of youth!

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:28.170
No, wait a second...

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.760
Does that mean...

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:30.640
It can't be...

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.140
No way! No way!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.440
Even if the curse is broken,

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:39.230
I will give up my life to defend your virginity.

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:43.650
Kiriko,

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:46.700
did you, by any chance...

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:49.620
I-I don't know what you mean!

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:29.310
Looks like the boss's rival is 
showing up next time, Chiharu-san!

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:30.600
I'd better get going!

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:32.500
Let's go, virgin! For Kei-chan!

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:34.610
Next time, another huge incident 
that will decide the fate of Japan!

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:35.600
Let's do this!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:37.710
But it looks like you and I aren't in it.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Next Time: 
Shigeyoshi of the Rebellion, 
The Bloody Surrender of Edo Castle!</b>

00:23:37.710 --> 00:23:38.890
What?!
